      "description": "Domain validation requires unique ordinary InstanceId/CardId, known physical card definitions, and each known source/parent frame to reference exactly its own InResolution accepted source while active or deferred for Operations. After that frame disposition, no entity may reference it and its source must occupy the printed resolved-event destination. The same domain check applies to fresh/choice preflight and historical receipt result, without comparing later live state."
